{"availability":"available","full":"omni-line/omni-audit","name":"omni-audit","description":"🛡️ A fast, zero-config CLI to audit your projects for Dependency Confusion and supply chain risks across multiple registries. Backed by Omni Line.","category":"Other","language":"Go","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-30T12:11:33Z","updated":"2026-10-03T10:43:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://omniline.app","topics":["cli","composer","dependency-confusion","golang","npm","security","supply-chain"],"demo":null,"color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Omni Audit is a fast, zero-config CLI that scans your project for dependency confusion and shadow registry risk. It discovers NPM, Composer, PyPI, Go, Cargo, RubyGems, Maven, Conan, and Docker Hub manifests, checks whether each declared name exists on the public registry, and reports names that are still unclaimed. It also audits lockfile resolution URLs and flags dependencies that pull from public registries instead of your internal proxy.","Distributed as a standalone Go binary. No Node or PHP runtime required."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/omni-line/omni-audit/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"49ec27988443f5b21686131579c8e5abf683b9c49122c62174e2828a9b3178a6","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Omni Audit is a fast, zero-config CLI that scans your project for dependency confusion and shadow registry risk. It discovers NPM, Composer, PyPI, Go, Cargo, RubyGems, Maven, Conan, and Docker Hub manifests, checks whether each declared name exists on the public